# Secret-bearing + bulky migration artifacts — never commit these.
# (Comments must be on their own line — an inline # does NOT start a comment in .gitignore.)

# holds real API keys once filled in
truenas-compose.yml
# APNs auth keys
*.p8
*.env
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.local

# Local migration data (huge, regenerable)
dump.sql
*.sql
# ...but migrations/ IS the schema of record and must be committed. The blanket `*.sql` above was
# aimed at dump.sql and local scratch SQL, and it silently swallowed NEW migration files: git only
# ignores untracked paths, so 001-006 kept working (already tracked) while 007_schema_drift.sql was
# invisible to `git add` with no error. Caught 2026-07-24 — the migration had to be force-added.
!migrations/*.sql
marketscope.db
marketscope.db-*
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
models/

# Build output
dist/
node_modules/
